# Format: one CVE per entry, with a dated justification comment directly above it.
# Example:
#   # CVE-2026-XXXXX: no fix available upstream as of 2026-08-01; re-review 2026-11-01.
#   CVE-2026-XXXXX
#
# Entries get added only against CVEs actually observed in a scan, never to make a
# build go green. This file starts empty — see docs/build.md for the review cadence.

